/**
@mainpage Original firmware and integration code

This reference is generated from project-owned C and Python files. The C headers
own API contracts; the source browser includes internal callbacks and helpers.
EXTRACT_ALL includes implementation symbols without implying every symbol has
a hand-written description. No SDK, dependency checkout, upstream coordinator
protocol code, runtime data or generated firmware is scanned.

Use the related **Nordic code reference** and **Coordinator code reference** pages
for file maps and PowerShell/JavaScript responsibilities. Those two pages are
included directly from the maintained docs; there is no second prose copy.
Doxygen does not parse the PowerShell or CommonJS interfaces in this configuration.

@section navigation Navigation
- Files: parsed C headers/implementations and Python helpers, with source links.
- Data structures: the portable observation snapshot and its fields.
- Related pages: integration code maps and regeneration commands.
- Search: symbol and file lookup within the generated reference.

@section generation Generation
From the repository root, run `./tools/documentation/Generate.ps1`.
The script checks the pinned Doxygen version. See tools/documentation/README.md
for portable-tool installation, output location and coverage limits.
*/
